{"completed": true, "response": "他和那个人一直相处得很自在、很亲近，这段关系对他来说很珍贵。他想说的事已经在心里放了一段时间，但他知道，如果把自己的心意说得太明白，两个人的关系就可能发生变化。他不想因为害怕关系改变，就把自己的愿望放下不管，但也还没想把这份愿望变成对对方的要求。现在不需要发生什么新事情，也不需要他先说服自己或想明白什么，他只是还没找到一种说法，能让自己愿意承担说出口之后可能带来的后果。", "metadata": {"session_handle": "2e851f88-ea32-460d-ba83-6c1d46a55609", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T002739298912Z", "elapsed_seconds": 6.516, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T00:27:45.816459+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "bc9ae7d82c6da0e6e504bb29012385e2d4fd55d627e6776abdbe82fa38ad9c82", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T002739298912Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha2